=== tcpdump ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tcpdump version 4.99.4 libpcap version 1.10.4 (with TPACKET_V3) OpenSSL
3.0.13 30 Jan 2024


USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  tcpdump [-AbdDefhHIJKlLnNOpqStuUvxX#] [ -B size ] [ -c count ] [--count] [
      -C file_size ] [ -E algo:secret ] [ -F file ] [ -G seconds ] [ -i
      interface ] [ --immediate-mode ] [ -j tstamptype ] [ -M secret ] [
      --number ] [ --print ] [ -Q in|out|inout ] [ -r file ] [ -s snaplen ]
      [ -T type ] [ --version ] [ -V file ] [ -w file ] [ -W filecount ] [
      -y datalinktype ] [ --time-stamp-precision precision ] [ --micro ] [
      --nano ] [ -z postrotate-command ] [ -Z user ] [ expression ]


POSITIONALS (1) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  expression


